sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Developer
    participant CLI as CLI
    participant FS as Local filesystem
    participant M as Model
    participant Sh as Shell
    U->>CLI: a task in plain language
    CLI->>FS: gather relevant context — files, tree, git state
    CLI->>M: task + context + the tools it may use
    M-->>CLI: proposed tool call — read, edit, or run
    alt needs approval
        CLI->>U: show the diff or the command
        U-->>CLI: approve
    end
    CLI->>FS: apply the edit
    CLI->>Sh: run the command
    Sh-->>CLI: output, exit code
    CLI->>M: feed the result back
    Note over CLI,M: the loop is local — your files never leave except as the context you send
